The '''Battlefront''' is a large battlefield just outside the western border of [[Great Kourend]]. It is where the majority of [[Shayzien]] soldiers fight the [[lizardmen]] to keep Kourend safe. Players can reach the Battlefront by casting [[Battlefront Teleport]], or running south-east from the [[fairy ring]] (code {{Fairycode|CIR}}).

The army here consists of [[Soldier (Battlefront)|soldiers]], [[Ranger (Shayzien)|rangers]] and [[doyen]]s led by [[General Vir]], with [[Lovakengj Engineer]]s helping to keep the siege weapons running. In addition, they have one on-field nurse, [[Nurse Emma Gentsy]], next to Vir's quarters in the north side. An ancient grave is located by the fountain, as well as several yew trees.

Unlike the [[Lizardman Canyon]], the battlefield is single-combat.

